WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,460
Okay, I got the man.

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:05,180
You are now popular and drink spicy food

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,300
Have you ever thought about your mother all your life?

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,940
I never even wore a gold ring and said so much.

5
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,840
Don’t you just want to share the money?

6
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,960
Your man won’t buy you a gold ring?

7
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:17,040
How do you talk to your mother?

8
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,840
A heartless thing

9
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:22,480
He really looks exactly like your bastard father, right?

10
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:25,060
Who told you to find a beast to marry?

11
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:27,700
In short, I will not give you money and hand it over to you.

12
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,380
You will give flowers to that man's son

13
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:30,660
He is a girl after all

14
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:31,820
Or am I a girl

15
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:34,620
How do you feel about holding back your breath to test yourself into a good man?

16
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:36,060
Doesn't he love you more?

17
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:40,740
This is my life

18
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:42,980
It was the first time I said such serious words to Meng Xilan.

19
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:44,300
This plan is risky

20
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:47,380
As for whether things will develop as I expected?

21
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,620
We'll have to watch Lu Ling's party on Saturday.
